# Netlify serves a Flutter web build as plain files, so a real path such as
# /verify?token=... (the link in a verification mail) or /game/ABC/player would
# 404 before the app loads. The app uses path URLs (lib/services/url_strategy_web.dart),
# so every unknown path has to reach index.html and let go_router resolve it.
# `flutter build web` copies this file into build/web/.

# The verification mail links to this page, not to the app: it is a plain file
# beside index.html and has to be served as itself rather than swallowed by the
# catch-all below.
/verify.html    /verify.html   200

/*    /index.html   200
